[00:03.06]And I felt it for ages
[00:06.81]Before she showed me the path
[00:10.06]My heart was in pieces
[00:13.88]Everything was falling apart
[00:18.57]
[00:18.87]“он ушел” 
[00:21.30]“lo odio” 
[00:24.02]“così felice”
[00:26.34]“I know you tried hard”
[00:29.29]“Siempre te amaré”
[00:31.59]“Das Leben ist hart”
[00:33.88]“Я страдаю”
[00:38.53]
[00:38.83]Stuck in the depths of darkness
[00:42.83]She called my name
[00:46.28]Casted the gaze
[00:50.21]Blank as the sun
[00:54.33]Revealing my path
[01:02.73]
